  "slug": "welsh-language",
  "title": "Welsh Language - Cross Party Group",
  "purpose": "To discuss and highlight relevant issues concerning the Welsh language and Welsh-speaking communities, in the Senedd and beyond; to collaborate to ensure a future for the language and the right of all to learn it, use it, and live their lives through the medium of Welsh in all communities in Wales; and to increase awareness of any issues affecting the language. The Group will enable stakeholders and politicians from different parties with an interest in Welsh to discuss issues concerning to the language, with the primary focus on the wellbeing and benefits of Welsh and an emphasis on achieving the vision and targets set out in Cymraeg 2050.",
